              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini wakuu wote waliwaambia mkutano wote, Sisi tumewaapia kwa BWANA, Mungu wa Israeli; basi sasa hatuwezi kuwagusa watu hawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.19",
